;; --- The failsafe copy of the configuration file, the one shipped with the software and
;; --- the lowest priority of the cascade read by bin/configuration.ml. It lands in
;; --- <prefix>/share/marionnet/share/marionnet.conf, which is where that cascade looks for
;; --- it since episode 25 of the work-stream `marionnet-todo-transverse'.
;; ---
;; --- Why from HERE and not from bin/share/, with the other shared files: until that episode
;; --- the repository carried TWO copies of this file, and the one which was installed
;; --- (bin/share/marionnet.conf) was the stale one -- it still set MARIONNET_BRIDGE=br0,
;; --- commented out here since episode 7b of `modernisation-world-bridge', which turns the
;; --- automatic LAN bridge off. Nobody noticed because the path being looked for did not
;; --- exist either: two defects cancelling each other. One file, one place, one source.
(install
 (files (marionnet.conf as share/marionnet.conf))
 (section share)
 (package marionnet))
